246	        // partitions which do not have a valid position and are not awaiting reset. This will
247	        // trigger an OffsetFetch request and update positions with the offsets retrieved. This
248	        // will only do a coordinator lookup if there are partitions which have missing
249	        // positions, so a consumer with manually assigned partitions can avoid a coordinator
250	        // dependence by always ensuring that assigned partitions have an initial position.
251	        if (isCommittedOffsetsManagementEnabled() && !refreshCommittedOffsetsIfNeeded(timer))
